high-tech toasters hidden in special space-saving compartments,

544
00:42:15,220 --> 00:42:19,680
and even conveyor belts to whisk away dirty dishes to sterilizers.

545
00:42:20,520 --> 00:42:25,400
With so much promise, the non-arrival of the house of the future is baffling.

546
00:42:26,360 --> 00:42:27,980
Come see the home of tomorrow.

547
00:42:27,981 --> 00:42:33,740
well we're often drawn to it as a kind of a spectacular piece of entertainment but

