00:43:23,221 --> 00:43:26,220
Yes, there were some real bad ideas. But I

561
00:43:26,221 --> 00:43:34,220
But a lot of these bad ideas led to the formulation of good ideas by other great inventors and maybe even the future, who knows.

562
00:43:35,220 --> 00:43:39,220
No matter that these ideas fell short of their intended goal,

563
00:43:39,221 --> 00:43:48,220
the world has a special place in its collective heart for forward thinkers, tinkerers and daydreamers who march to the beat of their own drum.

564
00:43:48,221 --> 00:43:52,220
Necessity might have mothered a notion that only its inventor could love,

565
00:43:52,221 --> 00:43:57,960
But the creative spark, no matter how dim, deserves even the occasional nod of recognition.

